t-$R$\">df-representable — Representable Set <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A \\subseteq \\mathbb{N}\">\\(A \\subseteq \\mathbb{N}\\)</span> (set parameter)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FV}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{FV}_G\\)</span> (free-variable function, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"b9e3d57e94ce36b7\" href=\"?note=b9e3d57e94ce36b7\" title=\"92-df-free-variable-function\">92-df-free-variable-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Subst}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Subst}_G\\)</span> (capture-avoiding substitution, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"725c1f1651ce9a00\" href=\"?note=725c1f1651ce9a00\" title=\"92-df-substitution\">92-df-substitution</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar n\">\\(\\bar n\\)</span> (numeral for <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span>, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"b78092e29a02d697\" href=\"?note=b78092e29a02d697\" title=\"92-df-numeral\">92-df-numeral</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> (system G, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"e0eabee5d77258a7\" href=\"?note=e0eabee5d77258a7\" title=\"92-df-g-system\">92-df-g-system</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vdash\">\\(\\vdash\\)</span> (provability relation, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"51c43e0240787ebb\" href=\"?note=51c43e0240787ebb\" title=\"92-df-provable\">92-df-provable</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Rep}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Rep}_G\\)</span> (definition-target representability predicate)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}representable} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Rep}_G(A)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{FV}_G(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\{v_0\\}\\land\n\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\Bigl[\n(n\\in A\\Longrightarrow G\\vdash\\mathrm{Subst}_G(\\varphi,\\bar n,v_0))\\land\n(n\\notin A\\Longrightarrow G\\vdash\\neg\\mathrm{Subst}_G(\\varphi,\\bar n,v_0))\n\\Bigr]\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}representable} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Rep}_G(A)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{FV}_G(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\{v_0\\}\\land\n\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\Bigl[\n(n\\in A\\Longrightarrow G\\vdash\\mathrm{Subst}_G(\\varphi,\\bar n,v_0))\\land\n(n\\notin A\\Longrightarrow G\\vdash\\neg\\mathrm{Subst}_G(\\varphi,\\bar n,v_0))\n\\Bigr]\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Rep}(A)\">\\(\\mathrm{Rep}(A)\\)</span> : 集合<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>在<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>中可表示</li>\n<li>可表示要求：成员实例可证，非成员实例的否定也可证</li>\n<li>可表达则是标准模型中的语义条件，并同样应使用无捕获代入后的闭句而非把公式当函数应用</li>\n<li>若<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>算术可靠，则可表示蕴含可表达；反向一般不成立</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-representable-—-Representable-Set-$R$","text":"df-representable — Representable Set $R$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"5a1bd470754681a7","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-numeral","status":"resolved","id":"b78092e29a02d697","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-numeral]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df